.env.*

# The production image type-checks whatever it copies: tsconfig.json includes
# `**/*.ts` and `**/*.mts`, and `next build` fails on any import it cannot
# resolve. So a harness entrypoint left here while the directory it drives is
# ignored breaks the image build and nothing else -- `./test.sh` builds in the
# full repository, where every one of these resolves. Keep each pair together.
e2e
playwright.config.ts
tests
vitest.config.mts
vitest.setup.ts
.oxlint-plugins
oxlint.config.mts
knip.jsonc
